{
  "comment": "job_* lines in cr-emit's shape (lentago/claytonia bin/cr-emit), before and after lentago/claytonia#173: the runtime stream label and line field, and cost_usd null when a runtime reports no cost. Grafana variables are replaced from vars; every line sits inside the 1h range.",
  "cases": [
    "r1 claude, numeric cost 1.25, success",
    "r2 claude, cost null and duration null: a failure that never produced JSON",
    "r3 gemini, cost null with token fields: priced by nobody until #304",
    "r4 legacy line, no runtime label or field, numeric cost 0.75, hand-dropped (submitter \"\"): lands under claude",
    "r5 claude, numeric cost 0.5, success",
    "r6 legacy job_running beat (lands under claude), r7 gemini job_running beat",
    "one local session_complete at 2.00, for Total spend",
    "spend = 1.25 + 0.75 + 0.5 = 2.50 runner (4.50 with local); unpriced = 2; success rate claude 3/4, gemini 1/1",
    "duration avg claude (90 + 30 + 60) / 3 = 60 with r2's null left out, not 45",
    "empty range (a project with no events): success rate returns no series, so the panel reads \"no jobs\" rather than 100%; counts read 0"
  ],
  "vars": {
    "project": ".*",
    "runid": ".*",
    "__range": "1h",
    "__auto": "1h"
  },
  "range_s": 3600,
